WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:80%
Tell the agent once.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000 line:80%
The agent finds and reads the saved notes.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000 line:80%
It links the past decision and its reason to this week’s material.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.000 line:80%
On the saved criteria, it drafts with this week’s new evidence.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:33.000 line:80%
You review only what changed and the next decision.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:37.500 line:80%
Not from scratch every time. Start from your previous work.
